# LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which checks every file out
# with CRLF and converts back on commit. Two things go wrong without this file:
# a first commit from a Windows machine rewrites the line endings of the whole
# repository into one unreadable diff, and any check that matches file contents
# has to care which platform wrote them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing here is binary, but say so for the ones a future contributor might add.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
